  "content": "<h1>更多貓品種</h1>\n<p>「More Cat Variants」模組將添加更多貓的變體。它們在所有玩家之間保持持久，並可通過資源包進行自定義。</p>\n<h2>內容</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>阿比西尼亞貓</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/17079dad123b01557b6618ff77782aef39efa63b.png\" alt=\"Abyssinian\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>索馬里貓</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b69e481b86fb12b5e9dde5d075058aff4e6961a4.png\" alt=\"Somali\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>斯芬克斯貓（無毛貓）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a9419f106e31dc9428a0f30e44bb2c7b208ec4c1.png\" alt=\"Sphynx\"></p>\n<h2>支援</h2>\n<p>🟨 26.1-26.1.2 / 🟩 1.21.1 / 🟥 1.21-1.21.11 / 🟩 1.20.1 / 🟪 1.16.5 / 🟪 1.12.2</p>\n<p>🟩 已支援<br>\n🟥 不再支援<br>\n🟨 開發中<br>\n🟪 考慮中</p>\n<h2>備註</h2>\n<p>歡迎在整合包、影片、直播或其他類似媒體中使用本模組。如果您喜歡這個模組，請考慮提供財務支持，我將不勝感激。</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/github-plural_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"See me on GitHub\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fmahmudindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/available/modrinth_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Available on Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@oreno69\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/youtube-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Watch me on YouTube\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/cuYgFmq3kz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/discord-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Chat with me on Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mahmudindes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/patreon-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252foreno\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/compact-minimal/donate/kofi-singular-alt_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Ko-fi\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsaweria.co%252fmahmudindes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/barraIhsan/devins-badges/blob/saweria/assets/compact-minimal/donate/saweria-singular_46h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Support me on Saweria\"></a></div>\n<p><br></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dimensionfixer\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionfixer/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionfixer/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Dimension Fixer\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dimensionlink\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-dimensionlink/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/dimensionlink/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Dimension Link\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/worldportal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-worldportal/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/worldportal/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"World Portal\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fA2PZGios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-vanillaworld/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/vanillaworld/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Vanilla World\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/passengersportalfix\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/mahmudindev/mcmod-passengersportalfix/blob/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/passengersportalfix/icon.png?raw=true\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" alt=\"Passeng